A compact way to write the opening rule is $\text{signal strength}
\approx
\text{move} \times \text{track record}.$ This is not a pricing formula. It is the lecture’s entrepreneurial filter. The same market rumor means less when it comes from an unknown speculator and more when it comes from someone with a visible history of finding large technology waves.

