p.src:
We can represent the imagined allocation map as $A:
\text{investor capital}
\longrightarrow
(\text{coins},\ \text{NFT assets},\ \text{projects}).$ The menu expands from two obvious crypto choices to three: $\begin{aligned}
\mathcal{S}_{\mathrm{old}}
&=
\{\text{coins},\ \text{NFT assets}\}, \\
\mathcal{S}_{\mathrm{new}}
&=
\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
\text{coins}, \\
\text{NFT assets}, \\
\text{NFT projects/companies}
\end{array}
\right\}.\end{aligned}$

