p.src:
The final entrepreneurial distinction is between the asset and the structure behind the asset: $\text{verified ownership}
\longrightarrow
\text{exclusive access}
\longrightarrow
\text{project-level business}
\longrightarrow
\text{new startup surface}.$ That is the durable mechanism. The NFT is not just an object to trade. It can also be the entry credential for a community, a brand, and a company-level business system that outside capital may want to fund.

